                <p>
                    <person sex="female" role="employee">
                        <occupation>Hushållerska</occupation>
                    </person> eller <person sex="female" role="employee">
                        <occupation>kokerska</occupation>
                    </person> söker plats hos <person sex="male" role="employer">ungherre</person> eller <person sex="male" role="employer">änkling</person>; har <ref type="reference">goda rek.</ref> Svar till <person sex="unspecified" role="mediator">E. Andersson</person>, <street type="application">Parkgatan 17</street>, <placeName type="application" ref="#helsingborg">Helsingborg</placeName>. <idno type="advertisement">STAH 12310</idno>.</p>
